# =========================================
# Language-specific sections (uncomment/use as needed)
# =========================================

# ---------- Node / JavaScript / TypeScript ----------
# Already covered above (node_modules, .env, dist, build, logs)

# ---------- Python ----------
# Already covered above (__pycache__, *.pyc, .pytest_cache, venv)

# ---------- Java / Gradle / Maven ----------
# Already covered above (bin/, out/, target/, *.class)

# ---------- Go ----------
# Already covered above (vendor/, *.exe, *.dll, *.so)

# ---------- PHP / Laravel ----------
