# *.apk
# *.aab
# *.ap_
# *.dex
# .gradle/
# local.properties
# /captures
# .externalNativeBuild
# .cxx

# ---------- Swift / iOS ----------
# Already covered above (DerivedData, *.xcuserstate, build)
/.claude

# ---------- Session / dev-only artefacts (NOT source) ----------
# Stray Windows-path-quoted files dropped at the repo root by past
# sessions (e.g. literal names like `C:Users…Temppatient.json`).
# These contain short-lived dev JWTs and never belong in the repo.
# Patterns cover:
#   - the unquoted form (`UsersBS01719*`)
#   - the colon-prefixed form (`C:UsersBS01719*`)
#   - the U+FFFD-replacement form (`C<U+FFFD>UsersBS01719*`) that
#     Windows produces when the `:` was incorrectly encoded — the
#     `*` wildcard absorbs the variable-width UTF-8 replacement char.
*UsersBS01719*

